comment2.text=\n\ Calculate\ and\ print\ the\ fine\ based\ on\ how\ many\ days\ the\ book\ was\ issued.\n\ Reference\ books\ are\ fined\ at\ Rs.\ 2/day\ over\ the\ limit;\ other\ books\ Rs.\ 5/day.\n
